      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    taxable_income = 115000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (0, 10000, 0.10),\n        (10000, 40000, 0.15),\n        (40000, 90000, 0.20),\n        (90000, float(\"inf\"), 0.25),\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0.0\n\n    for lower_bound, upper_bound, rate in tax_brackets:\n        if taxable_income > lower_bound:\n            income_in_bracket = min(taxable_income, upper_bound) - lower_bound\n            total_tax += income_in_bracket * rate\n\n    answer = round(total_tax)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
